 <Navbar />

<main class="page">
  <div class="content">
    <div class="header">
      <span class="date">January 25, 2026</span>
      <h1>Pulse v0.12.0 Released</h1>
      <p class="subtitle">Major stability improvements for Reactivity, Hydration, and Primitives.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="body">
      <p>
        We are excited to announce **Pulse v0.12.0**, a critical update focused on stabilizing the core runtime and ensuring 
        rock-solid reactivity across all primitives. This release addresses several key issues reported by the community regarding 
        nested loops, conditional rendering, and hydration mismatches.
      </p>

      <h2>🚀 What's New</h2>

      <h3>Unified Reactivity System</h3>
      <p>
        We resolved a "Split Core" issue where the runtime could be instantiated multiple times, causing signals to lose track of 
        their dependencies. In v0.12.0, the reactivity engine is guaranteed to be a singleton, ensuring that `createSignal` and 
        `createEffect` always communicate correctly, even across different bundles.
      </p>

      <h3>Smarter Hydration Scoping</h3>
      <p>
        Hydration logic has been rewritten to respect primitive boundaries. Previously, nested `List` or `Show` components could 
        accidentally inherit the wrong scope, breaking event handlers (like "Delete Item"). The new hydration engine uses 
        scoped traversal to ensure every element binds to the correct data item.
      </p>

      <h3>Enhanced Primitives</h3>
      <p>
        The `&lt;List&gt;` and `&lt;Show&gt;` primitives have been hardened. We fixed template compilation issues that prevented signals 
        from being tracked correctly in `when` and `each` attributes.
      </p>
      <h3>✨ v0.11.0 vs v0.12.0 Comparison</h3>
      <p>A detailed comparison of stability improvements:</p>
      
      <div class="table-container">
        <table>
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th>Aspect</th>
              <th>v0.11.0</th>
              <th>v0.12.0</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr>
              <td><strong>Reactivity Runtime</strong></td>
              <td>❌ Split (Multiple Inst.)</td>
              <td>✅ Unified (Singleton)</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td><strong>Hydration Scoping</strong></td>
              <td>❌ Leaks to parents</td>
              <td>✅ Scoped (Nested safe)</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td><strong>Primitives (List/Show)</strong></td>
              <td>❌ Attribute signals ignored</td>
              <td>✅ Signals invoked</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td><strong>Dev Server Cache</strong></td>
              <td>❌ Stale components</td>
              <td>✅ No-Cache Headers</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
      <div class="highlight-box">
        <strong>Upgrade Today:</strong>
        <code>bun update pulse</code>
      </div>

      <h2>changelog</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Fixed `hydrate` traversing into nested primitives unexpectedly.</li>
        <li>Fixed "Add Item" reactivity failure by enforcing Singleton Runtime.</li>
        <li>Fixed `Show` primitive toggle not working due to missing signal invocation.</li>
        <li>Improved `deleteItem` scoping in Lists.</li>
        <li>Added `Cache-Control` headers to Dev Server to prevent stale runtime issues.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</main>

